From: mlgprorektm8 <67933lance@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 18:27:52 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] ryGT: on-screen keyboard, offline livery scripts, custom
 decals

- On-screen keyboard: shadGT's inline IME and IME dialog are built into ryty_gpu and registered,
  so text fields (e.g. the livery design name) open the keyboard. sceKernelGetSystemSwVersion stub.
- GTS-005: whole-script replacements from <exe>\patches\scripts\*.ADC, served in place of the game
  script whose symbol table starts the same (RYGT_SCRIPTS=0 off, RYGT_LOG_SCRIPTS=1 logs reads).
- GTS-006: <exe>\decals\*.svg are copied to temp0\decals as <id>_<name>.svg for the patched GRIM
  script's offline "My Decals" (RYGT_DECALS=0 off).
- GTS-004 special paints off by default (RYGT_PAINTS=1 on); DIAG-106 text-entry log.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
